  "text": "Good morning, and welcome to the International Auto Parts Fair in Frankfurt. The fair is open from nine a.m. to six p.m. Hall three is for brakes and tires. Hall five is for paint and tools. The restaurant is on the first floor. Please have your visitor badge with you. It is free for all visitors. Enjoy the fair!",
